{
  "name": "dsh-video-to-knowledge",
  "version": "0.1.8",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness (dsh) 插件：把「视频链接 → 带时间戳的 Markdown 知识卡 → 落盘 kb/」整条 AJTC 触发链封装成开箱可用工具。含环境自检、素材准备、五项质量校验、查重、落盘、计数核验与大纲回写。常用提示词：①「把这个视频沉淀成知识卡：<链接>」②「分析这个视频的大纲和骨干，先不落库：<链接>」③「依次把这三个链接沉淀进 kb：<链接1> <链接2> <链接3>」④「B 站字幕抓不到，帮我配登录态」⑤「先自检环境，缺什么告诉我」⑥「检查 kb 里这批卡片的质量，不合格的按素材重写」。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "video-to-knowledge",
    "ajtc",
    "trigger-chain",
    "bilibili",
    "yt-dlp",
    "knowledge-base"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/yayuqianhuang/dsh-video-to-knowledge.git"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "prepack": "node scripts/clean-pack.mjs",
    "test": "node scripts/smoke.mjs",
    "clean": "node scripts/clean-pack.mjs"
  },
  "main": "index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "engine",
    "pipeline",
    "runner",
    "memory",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.1.0-rc.7 <0.3.0",
    "node": ">=22.19"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "manifestVersion": 1,
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  }
}
